  "html": "<p>The Catacombs layout is one of the most popular.  It is dark and gloomy and monsters appear slowly out of the darkness.  There are frequently many branching corridors.  Following a corridor to the dead end room, you will sometimes find a Champion and his support troops guarding four treasure chests.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<th>Catacombs Layout Appearance\n</th><th>Catacombs Layout Typical Map\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Layout_Dungeon.jpg\" title=\"Layout Dungeon.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"236\" src=\"/images/Layout_Dungeon.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Layout_Dungeon.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Map_Dungeon.jpg\" title=\"Map Dungeon.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"172\" src=\"/images/Map_Dungeon.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Map_Dungeon.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
